# Build-context hygiene for the realtime plane image (free-tier build minutes):
# corpus, captures, tool results, and VCS state are not part of the runtime closure.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
**/node_modules
.syllabai
tool-results
golden-captures
golden/llm-shadow
golden/retrieval-eval
books
apps/hub/content-maps
docs/golden
*.log
*.xlsx
